  "youtube": {
    "description": "it's 2001. minus thirty outside, the aurora's out and the ice is holding. first place. 🏁\nY2K drum & bass in the spirit of Rollcage Stage II and the PS1 racing era: breakbeats, rolling bass and that late 90s / early 2000s game soundtrack energy.\n\nPut it on for driving, gaming, coding, studying or just staring out the window pretending you're in a loading screen.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nTRACKLIST\n00:00 Momentum Line\n01:55 Frostbite Drive\n04:06 Throttle Protocol\n06:18 Coldstart Rush\n08:31 Hollow Gearshift\n10:44 Hidden Icefield\n12:57 Tundra Approach\n15:08 Polar Circuit\n17:22 Hidden Burnout\n19:33 Whiteout Run\n21:45 Northern Lights Rush\n23:59 Inertia Protocol\n26:11 Night Hoarfrost\n28:21 Hyper Permafrost\n30:32 Sub Zero Protocol\n32:46 Deep Countersteer\n35:00 Broken Glacier\n37:14 Snowblind Theory\n39:25 Sector Three Stage\n41:39 Black Ice Protocol\n43:52 Broken Floe\n46:05 Aurora Stage\n48:17 Downforce Transit\n50:29 Crevasse Rush\n52:41 Velocity Drive\n54:54 Boost Loop\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\n🏎️ Visuals: Digital Aura Racing Team\n🎛️ Music: original tracks generated with custom Python scripts\n💿 Inspired by the sound of Rollcage Stage II and classic PS1 racers. Not affiliated with or endorsed by the original game or its publishers.\n\nIf this takes you back, drop your favourite old racing game in the comments and subscribe for more Y2K DnB.\n\n#y2kdnb #drumandbass #ps1",
